IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `act-provisions`
IMPORT `act-determinative`

-- Tests for act-determinative.l4.
-- The expected answer for a section is read from the text: it is determinative where the section has a sentence declaring it so.

§ `Tests: determinative provisions`

-- s 5 (2) Example: "Section 4 (3) provides that s 4 is a determinative provision."
#ASSERT `s 5 (2), (3): the determinative status of a section of this Act` "4" EQUALS JUST `a determinative provision`
-- s 5 (3) Example: "Section 3 does not contain a provision corresponding to s 4 (3). Therefore, s 3 is not a determinative provision."
#ASSERT `s 5 (2), (3): the determinative status of a section of this Act` "3" EQUALS JUST `a non-determinative provision`
-- Section 6 (8) declares s 6 determinative.
#ASSERT `s 5 (2), (3): the determinative status of a section of this Act` "6" EQUALS JUST `a determinative provision`
-- Section 5 has no such sentence, so it is a non-determinative provision (s 5 (3): any other provision of this Act).
#ASSERT `s 5 (2), (3): the determinative status of a section of this Act` "5" EQUALS JUST `a non-determinative provision`
-- Section 146 (3), s 151 (4) and s 151A (3) declare the section determinative so far as it applies to an applicable law or provision.
#ASSERT `s 5 (2), (3): the determinative status of a section of this Act` "146" EQUALS JUST `a determinative provision so far as it applies to an applicable law or applicable provision`
#ASSERT `s 5 (2), (3): the determinative status of a section of this Act` "151" EQUALS JUST `a determinative provision so far as it applies to an applicable law or applicable provision`
#ASSERT `s 5 (2), (3): the determinative status of a section of this Act` "151A" EQUALS JUST `a determinative provision so far as it applies to an applicable law or applicable provision`
-- A section outside the in-scope text (chapter 18) is not answered: the text of that chapter is not among the in-scope sources.
#ASSERT `s 5 (2), (3): the determinative status of a section of this Act` "230" EQUALS NOTHING
-- A number that is not a section of the text is not answered either.
#ASSERT `s 5 (2), (3): the determinative status of a section of this Act` "9999" EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `One assertion for each declaration in the in-scope text`

